Adapted files (structure and approach; colours, icon drawings, names and
the rest of the code are kdraft's own; no FigCraft branding, names or
logos are used):

  FigCraft crates/ui-egui/src/theme.rs      -> crates/kdraft-ui/src/theme.rs
      (Tokens struct layout, applying tokens to egui Visuals and spacing)
  FigCraft crates/ui-egui/src/icons/draw.rs -> crates/kdraft-ui/src/icons.rs
      (pixel-hinting painter helper for icons on a 16-unit grid)
  FigCraft crates/ui-egui/src/widgets.rs    -> crates/kdraft-ui/src/widgets.rs
      (widget set and interaction model: lead-letter number fields with
      scrub and nudge, segmented control, section header with action
      icons, insertion line, drag ghost, inline rename, elision)
